---
source: core/src/orchestrator/tests/mod.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: Deactivate a Wasm skill. The skill is unloaded from the sandbox and stays disabled across restarts; its compiled artifact is preserved so it can be reactivated later. Use this if a skill is broken or no longer needed.
name: deactivate_skill
parameters:
  properties:
    skill_name:
      description: Name of the skill to deactivate
      type: string
  required:
    - skill_name
  type: object
